            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vpCiN",
              "name": "Final checklist",
              "fill": "$ss-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Review checklist: normal text ≥4.5:1; meaningful control boundaries ≥3:1; visible focus; 44px targets; labels independent of color; correct WIB dates; no nested row actions; reduced motion; keyboard / screen-reader validation during implementation. Control boundary now uses #737985 (3.74:1 on #1D2025); subtle #363A42 is decorative only.",
              "lineHeight": 1.6,
              "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
              "fontSize": 14,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "yfNdG",
              "name": "Archive guidance",
              "fill": "$ss-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Use the six numbered sections above as the current component catalogue. Archived variants and long feature notes remain in ARCHIVE; linear attendee journeys remain in UX FLOWS. Promotional-banner explorations are archived—not the default Discovery implementation. Existing screens and all source component IDs are preserved.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "qlfES",
              "name": "Review fixes / Implementation reference index",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 12,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "wUlG0",
                  "name": "Fix summary heading",
                  "fill": "$ss-text",
                  "content": "Review fixes applied / Canvas only",
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UOy38",
                  "name": "Discovery",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Populated final references: desktop bPzck, mobile UD5ps. Four illustrative rows demonstrate availability states, not a backend event limit. Sample states are independent scenarios, not proof of a real account’s reservations.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JEpoV",
                  "name": "Reservation management",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Reservation Details: confirmed bEpAt / YLqju; ordinary cutoff QWYrF / DBorm; affected-attendee exception HpRKu / vaakw; cancelled iIS7b / RPvNu. After-cancellation History Oh6uP / xoHNt shows persistent Cancelled status and feedback. The cancellation dialog requires explicit confirmation and waits for authoritative acceptance.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ygNMm",
                  "name": "Authentication",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Verification and password-recovery / reset pages now have desktop and mobile final references, including invalid/expired links and success states. A verification success with an active session can return to the preserved event destination; the signed-out example offers login. No automatic reservation is created. Resend controls use pending/failure feedback, not invented countdown limits or delivery guarantees.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uve1T",
                  "name": "Booking state consistency",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Full, Closed, Registered, Cancelled, verification-required and uncertain-network-result Event Details are composed at desktop and mobile widths. Scarcity is removed when ineligible. Already registered opens the existing reservation; an uncertain result asks users to check bookings before retrying. A started event uses Closed with a started-event reason.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K5qtI",
                  "name": "Contact and accessibility",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Organizer contact is read from existing ORGANIZER_CONTACT_EMAIL: koyutestdev@gmail.com. Controls now use #737985 with 3.74:1 contrast on #1D2025. Mobile Clear all targets are 44px high. Auth pages are nav-free. Decorative separators retain #363A42.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "eX8cw",
                  "name": "Approval boundaries",
                  "fill": "$ss-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "No application code, dependencies, schema or project documentation changed. Updating UX_SPEC.md to the supplied v1.1 and reconciling DESIGN_SYSTEM.md with the approved date-led pattern / 6px controls / 5px labels still needs separate file-specific approval. Keyboard, screen-reader, sticky-viewport and live backend behavior require implementation validation.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$ss-font",
                  "fontSize": 14
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
