              "name": "Responsive and accessibility guidance",
              "fill": "$ss-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Preserve the current date / text / status alignment and whole-row click behavior. On mobile, shorten the visible image area or suppress it if it competes with text; never fade the text itself. Keep a solid dark field behind metadata and an opaque status badge. Image cropping and text contrast must be checked for every cover. No new status, bookmark or booking behavior is introduced.",
